Members of the Vilnius City Municipality Council Paulė Kuzmickienė, Adomas Bužinskas, Gediminas Švilpa, Audrius Skaistys, Rasa Baškienė, former Seimas member Liutauras Kazlavickas, Chairman of the Young Conservator League Mantas Benkunskas, Arūnas Valinskas and Goda Karazijaitė were in the top ten of candidates.
