Povilas Mačiulis, a former vice-mayor of Kaunas, who has left his work in the municipality and the "Unified Kaunas" organization in the presidential election due to his support to Vygaudas Ušackas, does not plan to return to politics and promises to focus on business.
"I'm going to focus on business.
